@title In-app checkout payment flow
@subtitle Payments Engineering, Tidewater Grocers, design v2
@date 2026-09-22

## Payment sequence

diagram checkout sequence title="Checkout payment"

checkout: app "Mobile App" client
checkout: api "Checkout API" svc
checkout: fraud "Fraud Service" svc
checkout: gw "Payment Gateway" ext
checkout: ledger "Ledger" store
checkout: app -> api : POST /checkout with cart and card token
checkout: api -> fraud : score order
checkout: fraud --> api : risk score
checkout: note api : alternate branch, if risk score is above 80
checkout: api --> app : step-up verification required
checkout: note api : main branch, if risk score is 80 or below
checkout: api -> gw : authorize amount
checkout: gw --> api : auth code
checkout: api -> ledger : record pending charge
checkout: ledger --> api : entry id
checkout: api --> app : order confirmed

## Latency budget

data latency = Step,Budget (ms),Measured (ms); Fraud scoring,120,96; Authorization,450,512; Ledger write,40,31; Total checkout,800,811

table = Step,p95 budget (ms),Measured p95 (ms); Fraud scoring,120,96; Authorization,450,512; Ledger write,40,31; Total checkout,800,811

chart bar latency x=Step y=Budget (ms),Measured (ms) unit=ms labels title="p95 budget vs measured"

## Open issues

!! Authorization is over budget by 62 ms. The gateway's us-east endpoint is called from us-west-2.

Next steps:

1. Move to the regional endpoint.
2. Add a 2 second timeout with one retry.
3. Alert when total p95 exceeds 800 ms.
